218
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:04,120
<i>se stala samozvaným společenským centrem.</i>

219
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,600
<i>Lidé uvnitř…</i>

220
00:15:05,680 --> 00:15:06,680
Marío?

221
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:09,040
Co?

222
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:11,400
- Nevšimla sis?
